  "notable_quotes": [
    "N2 adsorption in Zn-ox-mtz does not fit a simple Langmuir model alone; it is described with a single-site Langmuir-Freundlich model at 298 K.",
    "ZU-301 shows very high calculated selectivity, with IAST CO2/N2 (15/85) selectivities of 445.0-758.0 and CO2/CH4 (50/50) of 128.8-134.9.",
    "ZU-301 CO2 isotherms at 278 and 298 K were also fitted accurately by a dual-site Langmuir model, consistent with two-site CO2 adsorption behavior."
